    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0868" n="857" xml:id="pg857"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.635 Neep/28: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gordon</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-18T16:00:00-05:00">December 18, 1937—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>78. Your telegram 114 of December 15, 6 p.m. We greatly appreciate Patton’s
                    helpful reports. A direct approach to the Amsterdamsche Bank regarding Neep does
                    not seem advisable, however, at least for the present.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
